    <p>I'm always interested in connecting with people working on data, technology, and business challenges.</p>

    <div style="margin-top: 2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem;">
      <div>
        <p style="color: var(--yellow); font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;">Email</p>
        <a class="button primary" href="mailto:tappa03@umd.edu" style="width: fit-content;">tappa03@umd.edu</a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p style="color: var(--yellow); font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;">LinkedIn</p>
        <a class="button primary" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rohithtappa/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" style="width: fit-content;">linkedin.com/in/rohithtappa</a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p style="color: var(--yellow); font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;">GitHub</p>
        <a class="button primary" href="https://github.com/roohith47" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" style="width: fit-content;">github.com/roohith47</a>
